IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FLASHDEC-V4.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-HEADS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NUM-SMS             PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THREAD-BLOCKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FLASHDEC-V4.
    IF NUM-HEADS == 0 OR NUM-SMS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE NUM-HEADS TO THREAD-BLOCKS.
    MULTIPLY 4 BY THREAD-BLOCKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 THREAD-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 NUM-SMS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
